  "_comment": "Domains whose links belong in a desktop app rather than a browser window. Adding an app is one object: the bundle id macOS launches, and the hosts it owns. Hosts match themselves and any subdomain, so 'notion.so' covers 'www.notion.so'. Leave Google's own domains out: a Drive or Docs link has to keep the account's browser profile, which is the whole point of the profile setting.",
